{"id":"calma","lemma":"calma","pos":"noun","rank":776,"glosses":["calm, stillness, peacefulness","tranquility, peace and quiet"],"ipa":"/ˈkalma/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"calmas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-calma.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tras la tormenta llegó la calma.","en":"After the storm, it was calm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333122","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"storm"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Debemos mantener la calma.","en":"We must keep calm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450356","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to keep"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"El mar está en calma.","en":"The sea is calm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821188","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"sea"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Deberías actuar con calma.","en":"You should act more calmly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586533","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to act, to behave"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Quiero hacer las cosas con calma.","en":"I want to do things calmly.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"},{"g":"with"},null]}]}